{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "037f23877bfbbf1c70603e10c3998d8d94fa580f1e364121250e5bec5b4f645f", "ja": "聖母と従者", "zh": "圣母与侍从", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0bc55644baec9946143fd2d9702dc443ac806285d740b291652ed7f2f459760f", "ja": "サイン会への打ち合わせ中、朋花は既に\n持っている立派なサインを披露する。\nプロデューサーはこれからの活躍を考えた\n率直な点を指摘し、朋花は期待とともに\nその進言を受け取るのだった。", "zh": "在商量签名会事宜时，朋花展示了自己已经拥有的漂亮签名。制作人考虑到她今后的发展，直率地指出了一点，朋花则带着期待接受了这番建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "947ca7b9ba3d36fb34ff62caca312bdc5cbd2bf56a632618da72272416905b05", "ja": "インストアライブに向けて\n朋花と打ち合わせ中……", "zh": "正在和朋花商量店内演出的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "ce0b364d9bbc7b800565a13157014e1f48f15ebf6fe82762c6d36fc88f7eef0f", "ja": "というわけで、レッスンはこのスケジュール表通りに\n進行しようと思ってる。あと、連絡事項は……。", "zh": "所以，训练就按这张日程表来进行吧。还有，其他通知事项是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "41fa0724ed2f44e8aab9d95cb3e8cb3bd4133e25dac500461f3e81ba62a69ff9", "ja": "あ、そうそう。サイン会に向けて、\n自分のサインを考えておいてもらわないとな！", "zh": "啊，对了。为了准备签名会，得先想好自己的签名才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "6981357bbdcee1a277b91d3e37f1887f67064937256ba64d1263fba211070e77", "ja": "私のサインは、とっくに決まっていますから。\n心配いりませんよ～♪", "zh": "我的签名早就决定好了。您不用担心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "7023e2cf65189dc58128256768466ca1f0998effa74897cea15b54324de4c449", "ja": "あ、そうなんだ。ははっ、やっぱりアイドルになって、\n真っ先に考えたりしたのか？", "zh": "啊，是这样啊。哈哈，果然是成为偶像后，第一时间就考虑这个了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "5cc39e4531923169d965cc639105f365d6fd3436048dae61baf59f83fd29976e", "ja": "……私がそんな浮ついた理由で、\nサインを考えるとでも～？", "zh": "……您觉得我会因为那种轻浮的理由，\n去构思签名吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "eaf0a3d3c4d87d89b97a8838b0720e4742b9bfd8d80ce7cef9dc7bf4a45b5709", "ja": "えっ……いや、そんな深い意味はないんだけど！\nまさか、できてると思わなかっただけで……。", "zh": "诶……不是，我没想那么深！只是没想到你已经设计好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "8f27fdea36b353a9daf2a2a950e12f02c3f2c24cc54717f9583619145844f6e7", "ja": "……わかっていないようですね～。\nそれでは、ご覧にいれましょう～。", "zh": "……看来您还没明白呢～。\n那么，就让您见识一下吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1008_null", "source_sha256": "67fd1ea6ec8247bcd64f4d46775b6065b8f0ee5541d2e022ec4fadc7a80e7d42", "ja": "サラサラサラ……\nサラサラサラサラ……", "zh": "沙沙沙……\n沙沙沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "fbd5c1a7e6ec28b09e1ca275ed6437617ed62997fa879e98010de9ad4af97310", "ja": "おお……。立派なサインだ……！", "zh": "哦……好漂亮的签名……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "4ce905e407994448aa7649bc40dcd7682b5116d5a36f4ec4be741cc1b1dd71f4", "ja": "サインは聖母の慈愛の証。子豚ちゃん達に求められる\nことは、幼いころから頻繁にありましたから。", "zh": "签名是圣母慈爱的证明。因为从小起，就经常有小猪仔们向我索要签名了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "2fd4ea6750defce1ba65f4997d781739780023e7cda8c5ab7f420a8c9d15dfd8", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ？\n幼いころから……。へぇ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊？\n从小就……原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "0230e95976f69b325d438ca3e2d6e3d8dbec29093335cba4427cc725a556ca4a", "ja": "アイドルになった以上、今後はより多くの子豚ちゃん達\nに愛を授けられることでしょう～。ふふっ♪", "zh": "既然成为偶像，今后应该就能将更多的爱赐予小猪们了吧～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "f18062d92d9bdc1f2e60417c902db5ba669ff5a264f62c409be8e7a8b6cf7d96", "ja": "……あ、そうだよな。ただ……。", "zh": "……啊，也是啊。只是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "9fd2a1981f5f09f85a6a597cb0e9c495cedcfee704abdc708e28447c91f5d2e7", "ja": "？　ただ？", "zh": "？只是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "04d202afb28e8767d7d19df87ba333fab684706328e041f1328a74714c82277c", "ja": "このサイン、けっこう複雑だと思って……。\nもう少しシンプルな方がよくないかな？", "zh": "我觉得这个签名……好像有点复杂。  \n要不要再简单一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "3d1b3594b89f2bdd5961b39dae285acefe19136b487fa932d20bb78a89ee6a49", "ja": "……。線のひとつひとつに愛をこめた聖母の署名に、\n問題があると……本気で言ってるんですか～？", "zh": "……在圣母将爱倾注于每一条线的签名上，你竟然认真地说……有问题吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "ad7efa0cb210a1bf109b375c46e618b8c9457b180d27bee7770024ec603efb11", "ja": "いや、朋花はアイドルとしてデビューしたんだ。\n名前も顔も、これからどんどん広まっていく。", "zh": "不，朋花你已经作为偶像出道了。\n今后你的名字和样貌都会越来越广为人知。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "91ecabacdc2c06890f061510c52c3aa1c468a2854fa66e154382edaa5e9684dd", "ja": "ファン…じゃなくて、子豚ちゃんの数もどんどん増えて\nいくと思う。きっと今までとは桁が違うくらいに。", "zh": "粉丝……不对，子猪仔的数量也会越来越多吧。肯定会多到和以前完全不是一个数量级。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "ace2e9c1416d8aeaec99cc43d3d30a43bffd515565257921fac02efe1858d004", "ja": "今の朋花のサインは、イベントで続けて何枚も書くのが\n負担になりそうだし、書ける数も限られると思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，现在朋花的签名要是在活动上连续签好多张，可能会成为负担，而且能签的数量也很有限。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "3ea4851c5443cc9dd2399df8a83cb3cbbfd5a102cfa0971ce2eaef7be0154235", "ja": "それじゃ子豚ちゃん達も悲しむだろうし。\n今のうち、少しアレンジした方が……いいかなって。", "zh": "那样的话，小猪们也会伤心的。而且我想着，趁现在还来得及，稍微调整一下……是不是更好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "a81e0bd10799329df282f032181ed38c73e47ea395b1a758c10bd05b8366289b", "ja": "ふふっ。聖母に真っ向から意見するとは。\nなかなか豪胆で鈍感ですね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，居然敢正面反驳圣母。还真是大胆又迟钝呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "53ad3a72483a711bbae244ac96442c4a606cb4df8db486afb9fe77e2c7b64601", "ja": "え、そうかな……。ん？　鈍感？", "zh": "诶，是吗……嗯？迟钝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "64fcd31e9c0276350329825f7e48571f237aaff7faa535fd9ec4b5fa10c6c338", "ja": "ですが聖母にかしずく従者としては、悪くありません。\n今の進言、心に留めておきましょう～。", "zh": "不过，作为侍奉圣母的侍从，这倒也不坏。\n刚才的进言，我会记在心上的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "3c0d183803104e45b5d34b9b3d16177bc870111ca22ea253a7536c9a4698f6c0", "ja": "そ、そうか、従者……。\nうん、ありがとう！", "zh": "这、这样啊，侍从……  \n嗯，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "0a610bca38edead2d1de2338b0aebf2eab075b4a53e77f1145dfacc72ea2ea18", "ja": "ただし。\n聖母に意見した責任は、とってもらいますよ～？", "zh": "不过，你可要为对圣母提意见负起责任哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "2844a5be14de566fcac4935964e5d4056de917c1728568dba0fe1b1a3d556138", "ja": "サインを書くのが負担になるほど、今度のイベントも、\nこの先のお仕事も、劇場がオープンした後も……。", "zh": "忙到连签名都成了负担，无论是接下来的活动、今后的工作，还是剧场开幕后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "6d9353778414007eb0a81a4ab6078d2ebb814a32adb8b04b768ebdc22b5e7503", "ja": "客席が満員になるよう、しっかり采配してください。\nでないと、お仕置きですからね～？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "为了让观众席能够坐满，请好好发挥您的调度能力哦。\n不然的话，可是要受罚的呢～？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_01_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "ceb91b3fe6730eceab210b0baf9e93f1ed0e19286800d774987077070775aa57", "ja": "……ああ、任せてくれ！", "zh": "……好，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
